# 공개 API 계약: project_path_gateway_add KEY PATH (등록, 기능 004 US1·US2·US4, contracts/library-api-add-update.md)
# 가상 파일 시스템은 call 사이에 바뀐 상태를 이어 주지 않는다. 결과는 같은 call의 op write 원문으로 확인하고,
# 뒤이은 조회·검증은 바뀐 원문을 fs로 주고 caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT로 루트를 준 별도 사례로 확인한다.
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs

# 인자·초기화·인자 규칙 (계약 2절 1~8행, FR-002·FR-003·FR-010·FR-015): 데이터 파일을 읽거나 쓰지 않는다
case edit-invalid-add-argument-count
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR docs extra
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-not-initialized
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-key-lowercase
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add docs new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): docs
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-path-empty
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR \e
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 경로가 비어 있습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-path-absolute
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR /abs
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 경로는 /로 시작할 수 없습니다: /abs
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-path-parent-segment
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR ../out
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: ../out
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-path-carriage-return
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR a\rb
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 경로에 CR 문자를 쓸 수 없습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-path-line-feed
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR a\nb
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 경로에 LF 문자를 쓸 수 없습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case edit-invalid-add-key-and-path-both-wrong
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add docs /abs
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): docs
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

# 등록 성공 (US1-1~4, FR-020·FR-023·FR-024, 계약 3절): 출력 없음, 반환 0, 모드 보존 복사 → 새 원문 쓰기 → 교체.
# 새 원문은 규칙을 통과한 KEY·PATH 한 줄과, 이미 검사를 통과한 기존 줄 바이트로만 이루어져 데이터 파일 규칙을 만족한다.
case add-to-comment-only-file
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 경로 항목
content # KEY=경로
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR docs
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf #\s경로\s항목\n#\sKEY=경로\nDOCS_DIR=docs\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-after-two-entries
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A_DIR=a
content B_DIR=b
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add C_DIR c
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A_DIR=a\nB_DIR=b\nC_DIR=c\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-path-with-space-korean-equal
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NOTE_DIR 내\s문서/a=b
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf DOCS_DIR=docs\nNOTE_DIR=내\s문서/a=b\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-path-that-does-not-exist
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add MISSING_DIR not/yet/created
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf DOCS_DIR=docs\nMISSING_DIR=not/yet/created\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-last-line-without-lf
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content-raw A_DIR=a
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add B_DIR b
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A_DIR=a\nB_DIR=b\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-to-empty-data-file
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add B_DIR b
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf B_DIR=b\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-key-present-only-in-comment
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # DOCS_DIR=old
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR docs
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf #\sDOCS_DIR=old\nDOCS_DIR=docs\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

case add-after-init-in-same-session
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR new
status 0
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf DOCS_DIR=docs\nNEW_DIR=new\n
op move /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0

# 등록 뒤 조회·검증 (SC-001, SC-004, FR-014): call 사이 파일 상태가 이어지지 않으므로 등록 뒤 원문을 fs로 준다.
case add-then-get-prints-absolute-path
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
content NEW_DIR=new
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_get NEW_DIR
status 0
out /t/root/new
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0

case add-then-verify-reports-missing
fs dir /t/root/docs
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
content NEW_DIR=not/yet/created
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_verify
status 1
err project-path-gateway: 누락: NEW_DIR=not/yet/created
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1

# 이미 등록된 키 거부 (US2-1·2, FR-012, SC-002): 경로가 같아도 오류, 데이터 파일 변경 없음
case add-rejects-existing-key-other-path
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR manual
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 이미 등록된 키입니다: DOCS_DIR
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2

case add-rejects-existing-key-same-path
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_add DOCS_DIR docs
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 이미 등록된 키입니다: DOCS_DIR
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2
